  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$z^2+3 i=z(2+3 i)-7-4 i$<br/>$\\mathrm{z}^2-\\mathrm{z}(2+3 \\mathrm{i})+7+7 \\mathrm{i}=0$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/-rweKsieqmS1LBcSoo_sAW2SM7SCVllbRatlEGe1Za0.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& z_1^2+z_2^2=\\left(z_1+z_2\\right)^2-2 z_1 z_2 \\\\\n& =4-9+12 i-14-14 i \\\\\n& =-19-2 i<br/>\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
